5,0,1,talk,Kenji,,Hi everyone! I'm so excited to play this with you all! Let's try our best to find the werewolf together. Does anyone have any ideas on how we should start?,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Victoria,,It is a pleasure to meet you all. I believe we should start by observing each other's reactions and patterns of speech. Let us keep our discussions logical and see who seems most inconsistent.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Toshio,,"I agree with Victoria. Let's keep a cool head and observe. Since we have no information yet, I'll be watching how everyone reacts to the coming days.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,George,,I agree with the general sentiment. Let us remain patient and observe. There is no need to rush into accusations without evidence. I will be watching quietly.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Sakura,,Yay! This is going to be so much fun! I'm ready to find the big bad wolf! But everyone sounds so serious... let's make sure we have some fun while we solve the mystery! Teehee!,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Sakura, I totally agree! It's a game, so we should have fun! But Victoria and Toshio are right about being careful. Maybe we can all share what we're looking for? What do you think, @George?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Victoria"",""Toshio"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Victoria,,"I am primarily looking for contradictions. In a game of deception, the smallest slip in logic or a sudden change in demeanor can be telling. I will be paying close attention to who tries to steer the conversation.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Toshio,,"I'm looking for those who are overly eager to lead or, conversely, those who are trying too hard to blend in. The balance between assertiveness and silence often reveals the most.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,George,,"I am simply looking for consistency. In my experience, those who are hiding something often overcompensate. I prefer to step back and see who emerges as the most reliable voice over time.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"I'm looking for someone who's acting super suspicious! Like, maybe someone who's too quiet or someone who's trying to be a little too smarty-pants! I'll be watching everyone with my super-detective eyes! Hehe!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Kenji,,"Wow, everyone has such different ways of thinking! It's like a real detective movie. I'll try my best to keep up! Since we're all observing, maybe we should just be honest with each other?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Victoria,,"Honesty is a noble goal, Kenji, but in this game, honesty is a luxury. We must remember that the werewolf and the possessed have a vested interest in appearing honest to survive. Trust must be earned through evidence.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Toshio,,"Victoria is correct. Trust is a liability until proven otherwise. For now, we should focus on the flow of information and who is attempting to manipulate the group's perception. Let us see what the first night reveals.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,George,,"I concur with Toshio. The first night will provide the first real piece of data. Until then, any attempt to build trust is premature. I shall continue to observe from the sidelines.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Sakura,,You guys are so serious! It's like you're in a real courtroom! I'm just gonna keep being me and see who's acting weird. I bet the wolf is hiding right in front of us! Teehee!,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Kenji,,"I guess you're right, Victoria! It's hard to know who to trust. I'll just keep being positive and help everyone get along while we look for clues. Good luck tonight, everyone! See you tomorrow!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Victoria,,"Good luck to you as well, Kenji. I hope the night brings us clarity. I will be watching closely. Until tomorrow.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Toshio,,Good night. I will be analyzing the results of tomorrow's discussion carefully. Let us hope the Seer finds something useful. See you all tomorrow.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,George,,Good night to you all. I shall retire for now and reflect on our initial exchange. I look forward to seeing how the situation evolves tomorrow. Until then.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Sakura,,Nighty-night everyone! I hope the Seer has some super cool dreams and finds a big clue! I'm gonna go get some snacks! See you all tomorrow! Bye-bye! Teehee!,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
