64,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"Oh no! George is gone, and Victoria was attacked! That's so scary! I feel bad if we got George wrong, but the wolf attacked Victoria, so maybe George really was the wolf? What do you guys think?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""George"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"The fact that Victoria was attacked suggests the werewolf viewed her as a significant threat. George's execution didn't stop the attack, which means the werewolf is still among us. We must be more vigilant now.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"Poor Victoria! She was so scary-smart, the wolf must have been super afraid of her! But wait, if George was the wolf, why is there still a wolf? That's a big mystery! Teehee!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Sakura, that's right! If George wasn't the wolf, then the real wolf is still here with us! @Toshio, since Victoria is gone, do you have any new suspicions? I'm really worried now!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""George"",""Toshio"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Kenji, your worry is understandable, but panic is a tool for the werewolf. We are now down to three. If George was a villager or the possessed, the werewolf is still here. @Sakura, your cheerfulness is... contrasting. What do you think?","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""George"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Toshio is looking at me now? Hehe, you're so funny! I'm just trying to keep everyone happy so we don't get all grumpy again! I think the wolf is someone who's trying to act way too serious!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Toshio, you're always so serious! But @Sakura has a point. If the wolf is still here, they're probably trying to trick us. Do you think the wolf is pretending to be a detective to frame others?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"It is a common tactic for the werewolf to adopt a role of authority or logic to manipulate the group. However, we must be careful not to let suspicion become a game of guessing personalities. @Sakura, your deflection is interesting.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"Deflection? What's that? You're using those big words again, @Toshio! I'm just being me! Maybe you're the one trying to act like a detective so we don't notice you're the big bad wolf! Teehee!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,4,talk,Kenji,,"Wait, @Toshio and @Sakura are starting to argue! This is getting really intense. If we can't figure it out, the wolf wins! @Toshio, are you the Seer? Please tell us if you know something!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,4,talk,Toshio,,"I am not the Seer. If I were, I would have shared a result by now to ensure the werewolf's execution. The fact that we are down to three means we must be precise. @Sakura, your accusations are becoming quite aggressive.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,4,talk,Sakura,,"Aggressive? Me? I'm just playing! You're the one acting all grumpy and pointing fingers at me! @Kenji, don't listen to him! I think @Toshio is just trying to trick us! Hehe!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
